cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Schede: client records and session notes for a therapy practice (db, 2004–2022)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Schede is the client file of a therapy practice. Each client record holds personal and contact data, presenting complaints and the personal profile used by the therapist; each session records date and time, the analyses performed, symptoms, therapy and notes. The application prints the client sheet, the appointment list and the relations between clients."
authors:
